WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.720
Hi, I'm Paul Zwick, founder of AXIOM.

2
00:00:03.210 --> 00:00:04.600
I wanted to speak with you directly.

3
00:00:04.980 --> 00:00:06.730
We all know we have to adapt to AI.

4
00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:08.280
It's just a matter of when.

5
00:00:08.720 --> 00:00:09.830
Those who do it first…

6
00:00:10.370 --> 00:00:11.140
will survive.

7
00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:12.450
Those who don't…

8
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:14.000
won't.

9
00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:16.070
AI is not going to replace your job.

10
00:00:16.780 --> 00:00:19.140
The doctor that already has the AI will.

11
00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:20.680
Every month you wait…

12
00:00:21.350 --> 00:00:22.700
you fall further behind…

13
00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:24.280
losing patients…

14
00:00:24.900 --> 00:00:25.970
and burning hours.

15
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:27.620
Stop the bleeding.

16
00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:29.170
Start the healing.

17
00:00:30.010 --> 00:00:31.470
Besides your medical degree,

18
00:00:32.130 --> 00:00:34.500
this is the single best investment

19
00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:36.850
you'll ever make in your career.

20
00:00:37.380 --> 00:00:38.670
It pays for itself…

21
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:41.500
month after month.

22
00:00:41.810 --> 00:00:44.300
Sure, you can find other options out there.

23
00:00:44.300 --> 00:00:46.710
Probably cheaper, too.

24
00:00:47.040 --> 00:00:48.890
But none of them will give you

25
00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:50.350
a greater return on your investment.

26
00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:52.710
None will handle the whole process
as efficiently,

27
00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:54.400
or with the built-in checks for accuracy

28
00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:57.000
that MIA provides.

29
00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.200
None of them can fluently speak and transcribe

30
00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.170
over 100 languages
plus 22 dialects of Chinese.

31
00:01:01.540 --> 00:01:04.700
None of them have a $1 MILLION
LIABILITY POLICY behind their AI.

32
00:01:04.700 --> 00:01:05.900
You know why?

33
00:01:05.900 --> 00:01:07.590
Because they aren't confident in it.

34
00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:09.600
I AM.
